{"ticker":"BLTE","generated_at_utc":"2026-10-27T01:20:39.456616Z","profile":{"name":"Belite Bio, Inc","exchange":"NasdaqGS","country":"United States","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","website":"https://www.belitebio.com","summary":"Belite Bio, Inc, a clinical stage biopharmaceutical drug development company, engages in the research and development of novel therapeutics with unmet medical needs in the United States. Its lead product candidate is Tinlarebant (LBS-008), an orally administered, which is in phase 3 clinical trial as an early intervention for maintaining the health and integrity of retinal tissues in stargardt disease type 1 and geographic atrophy patients. The company also develops LBS-009, an retinol binding protein 4 oral therapy, which is in preclinical development targeting liver disease, including non-alcoholic fatty liver disease, nonalcoholic steatohepatitis, and type 2 diabetes, as well as gout. Belite Bio, Inc was founded in 2016 and is based in San Diego, California. Belite Bio, Inc operates as a subsidiary of Lin Bioscience International Ltd."},"stats":{"price":143.35,"marketCap":5773011968.0,"revenueGrowth":null,"operatingMargins":0.0,"fcfMargin":null,"netCash":0,"trailingPE":null,"priceToSales":null,"beta":-1.234,"debtToEquity":null,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":90.765,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":200.0,"avgVolume":181942.0},"bars":[{"d":"2025-10-27","o":92.5,"h":94.0,"l":92.14,"c":93.82,"v":46000},{"d":"2025-10-28","o":93.5,"h":93.9,"l":90.765,"c":93.02,"v":63200},{"d":"2025-10-29","o":92.41,"h":98.22,"l":91.401,"c":98.0,"v":158900},{"d":"2025-10-30","o":97.5,"h":99.0,"l":95.29,"c":98.1,"v":79100},{"d":"2025-10-31","o":98.85,"h":107.0,"l":97.985,"c":105.905,"v":136000},{"d":"2025-11-03","o":107.5,"h":115.41,"l":107.0,"c":112.4,"v":160800},{"d":"2025-11-04","o":111.19,"h":116.24,"l":109.0,"c":111.08,"v":145800},{"d":"2025-11-05","o":111.23,"h":114.66,"l":111.0,"c":112.42,"v":83800},{"d":"2025-11-06","o":113.32,"h":113.809,"l":111.0,"c":111.73,"v":